---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import Monogram from '../components/Monogram.astro';
import Wordmark from '../components/Wordmark.astro';
import Equation from '../components/Equation.astro';
---

<Page
  title="About"
  description="Alan Chester · 15+ years across kernel engineering, security, cloud, and AI product strategy. The second major technology transition."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-prose px-6 pt-16 pb-24">
    <header class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4">
      <Monogram size="lg" />
      <Wordmark as="h1" size="lg" />
      <Equation size="md" />
    </header>

    <section class="mt-12 space-y-5 text-lg leading-[1.7] text-graphite dark:text-mist">
      <p>
        Fifteen years spanning kernel engineering, security practice, cloud product
        leadership, and AI product strategy. I&rsquo;ve built cloud platforms from
        scratch: secured funding, bootstrapped teams, shipped product, and drove
        enterprise adoption.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is the second major technology transition I&rsquo;ve navigated. The
        first was cloud. Now it&rsquo;s AI, and the pattern is familiar.
      </p>
      <p>
        Computer Science taught me to build systems that run in production.
        Applied Mathematics taught me how AI models actually work underneath.
        Security taught me to see risk others miss. An MBA in progress is the
        habit of proving ROI rather than assuming it.
      </p>
      <p>
        The philosophy is borrowed from real analysis. <span class="equation">ε</span> is whatever the
        world demands. Uptime, accuracy, security, ROI. <span class="equation">δ</span> is the move that
        meets it. The data says when to pivot.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-16 border-t border-mist pt-10 dark:border-graphite">
      <p class="eyebrow">Currently</p>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-graphite dark:text-mist">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1 w-3 shrink-0 bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>Building AI systems and researching reinforcement learning.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1 w-3 shrink-0 bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>MBA candidate, NC State Jenkins School of Business.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1 w-3 shrink-0 bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>Writing about the incentive structures that shape technology decisions.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-16 border-t border-mist pt-10 dark:border-graphite">
      <p class="eyebrow">Connect</p>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 font-mono text-sm">
        <li>
          <a href="mailto:amcheste@gmail.com" class="text-muted no-underline hover:text-accent">
            amcheste@gmail.com
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/alan-chester-8757b98b/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-muted no-underline hover:text-accent"
          >linkedin.com/in/alan-chester-8757b98b</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/amcheste"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-muted no-underline hover:text-accent"
          >github.com/amcheste</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://x.com/amcheste"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-muted no-underline hover:text-accent"
          >x: @amcheste</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</Page>
